msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Wolfenstein 3D (ECWolf)"
msgstr "Wolfenstein 3D (ECWolf)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "ECWolf is an advanced source port for Wolfenstein 3D, Spear of Destiny, and Super 3D Noah's Ark based off of the Wolf4SDL code base."
msgstr "ECWolf — это продвинутый порт исходного кода для игр Wolfenstein 3D, Spear of Destiny и Super 3D Noah's Ark, основанный на кодовой базе Wolf4SDL."

msgctxt "#30001"
